# Restricted material downloaded from swift.com / MyStandards (bank usage
# guidelines, CBPR+, CGI-MP). It stays in the maintainer's own storage, never
# here; tests/test_no_restricted_material.py fails the build if any slips in.
# Exports are named <publisher>_<message>_..., which no bundled file is.
*MyStandards*
*_pain.[0-9]*
*_pacs.[0-9]*
*_camt.[0-9]*
*swift.cbprplus*
*CGI-MP*
*_externalcodesets_*.xlsx
*.ug.xsd
scenarios/**/*.pdf
scenarios/**/*.xlsx
scenarios/**/*.zip

# mutmut 3 working copy and results
mutants/
